    "Drag the toast anywhere and it comes back there, instead of the bottom-right corner. If the screen it was on has gone - undocked, or a display switched off - it returns to the corner rather than opening somewhere you cannot reach it, since it has no taskbar button. Turning this off forgets the saved position.":  "记住浮窗移动后的位置。如果该屏幕被断开或关闭，浮窗会回到右下角而不会出现在无法访问的位置。关闭此项会清除已保存的位置。",
    "Show the chat-list name":  "显示聊天列表名称",
    "Off shows what you asked; on shows the name defined in Scout's chat list. Turning this on lets the companion type into Scout's chat search now and then - that is the only way the sidebar reveals the timestamps needed to tell which chat is which, and it only does it while no Scout window is in front. Either way, clicking a session still switches to the right conversation.":  "关闭时显示你的请求，开启时显示 Scout 聊天列表中的名称。开启后，仅在 Scout 不在前台时使用聊天搜索来识别会话。无论哪种设置，点击会话仍会切换到对应对话。",
